      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, reused non-author reconciler context. The three near/far occurrences and all repeated forms keep their own source roles. The second gzugs owns form in the between relation; the earlier object is a reprise. The dbang gis causal relation is distributed and omitted rather than assigned to depending on distance. The full appearing-aspect phrase owns impression; clear is unwrapped. Matrix negation is a phrase, not the inner appearance negatives. Three negative-side predicate repetitions and the shared question predicate are explicit ellipsis nulls; two active agentives are grammatical-fusion nulls. The sole name and assertion own one English occurrence each. No source wording or hgm_gloss is changed."
